      title: 'My Next Summer Holiday Plan',
      passage: `This summer, I am going to go on holiday with my best friend, Laura, and I am very excited about it.\n\nWe are going to fly to Greece and stay on the island of Santorini for one week. We are going to stay in a small hotel near the beach, and our room has a beautiful view of the sea — I have already seen photos, and it looks amazing.\n\nEvery morning, we are going to swim in the sea before it gets too hot, and in the afternoon, we are going to relax by the pool and read our books. I am going to bring three books with me, all mystery novels, because I love a good mystery on holiday.\n\nIn the evenings, we are going to explore the small streets of the town, try different restaurants, and watch the famous Santorini sunset, which everyone says is one of the most beautiful in the world. Laura wants to take a boat trip around the island too, so we are probably going to do that on one of the days.\n\nWe are also going to visit some ancient ruins because Laura loves history, even though I find it a little boring sometimes! To make her happy, I am going to go with her and try to learn something new.\n\nI can't wait for this holiday. After a stressful year at university, I really need some sun, sea, and relaxation with my best friend.`,
